  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "事業廢棄物處理與資源循環特論",
    "sub_ename": "SPECIAL TOPICS OF INDUSTRIAL WASTE TREATMENT AND RESOURCE CIRCULATION",
    "describe_ch": "國內不同行業製程所產生之事業廢棄物種類與數量繁多，其成分特性差異甚大，許多事業單位與環保機構面臨如何妥適處理與資源化之困難。本課程深入介紹國內目前主要產業之指標性、急迫性或難處理之一般事業廢棄物與有害事業廢棄物的各項處理與再利用技術、原理、設備，以及國內外新興的處理與資源化技術、未來管理與發展趨勢等相關議題，使學生對各種事業廢棄物處理與資源循環技術與問題能有充分之瞭解認識，增加專業知識與實務應用能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The types and quantities of industrial waste generated from various processes and factories are numerous, and their compositions and characteristics vary greatly. Many companies and environmental protection agencies are faced with the difficulty of how to properly handle and recycle them. This course introduces the various available treatment and recycling technologies, principles, and equipment for the indicative, urgent, or difficult-to-treat general industrial waste and hazardous industrial waste, as well as emerging treatment and resource recovery technologies, and the management and development trends in the future. Students can have a full understanding of various industrial waste treatment and resource circulation technologies and issues, increase their professional knowledge and practical application capabilities.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解不同事業廢棄物之成分特性與處理再利用技術和原理\t",
      "describe_en": "Understand the compositions, characteristics, treatment and recycling technologies and principles of different industrial wastes"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備事業廢棄物處理與資源化技術之規劃設計與操作管理能力\t",
      "describe_en": "Possess the ability to plan, design, and operate and manage industrial waste treatment and resource recovery technologies"
    }
  ],
